Commodity patterns combine inclusions and exclusions in CLI and API.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight investment-performance --accounts 'Assets:Fund' --commodities FUND --commodities USD --commodities '~USD'

========== API ==========

investmentPerformance({ accounts: ['Assets:Fund'], commodities: ['FUND', 'USD', '~USD'] })

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  default
  format 1,000.00 USD
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash
P 2024-01-01 FUND 100 USD
2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Fund  1 FUND {100 USD}
  Assets:Cash  -100 USD

========== OUTPUT ==========

Investment performance from 2024-01-01 to 2024-01-01
Instruments: 1
Opening value: 0.00 USD
Net contributions: 100.00 USD
Ending value: 100.00 USD
Profit/loss: 0.00 USD
Time-weighted return (total): 0.00 %
Time-weighted return (annualized): n/a
Money-weighted return (total): n/a
Money-weighted return (annualized): n/a

========== API-OUTPUT ==========

{
  "from": "2024-01-01",
  "to": "2024-01-01",
